Stack: Vite, React, TypeScript, Tailwind, Motion, Recharts.
Mobile first, 360px wide. Large tap targets (min 48px). Simple English.
Animate only transform and opacity.
All data is read from /public/data/*.json. Never hardcode game data in components.
Types live in src/types.ts. Do not change them unless told.
One component per file, under 150 lines.
No external image files. Use SVG or emoji icons.
